      "$schema": "https://srs.semanticops.com/schema/2.0/composition.json",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-21T16:45:25Z",
      "description": "Every passage quoted from a source, with where it came from and which claims it supports. Generated — edit the quotation records, not this file.",
      "exportConfig": {
        "format": "markdown",
        "preamble": "<!-- rendered from muSrs; do not edit -->\n# Quotes\n\nPassages from sources, each with a locator and the level at which it was checked. `Checked to` describes this reading, not the strength of the claim it supports: a passage copied from a secondary summary is `secondary` however good the argument resting on it. Every quotation whose source text is reachable is verified word for word by `scripts/check-quote-fidelity.mjs`."
      },
      "id": "031a47b5-a34a-46b8-be1e-021c264ccd8a",
