      "createdAt": "2026-09-13T00:00:00Z",
      "description": "Repository-scoped compact entry point for active argument decisions. This is intentionally a card index: it renders the argument decision only and relies on explicit semantic relations for context-aware retrieval of its boundary, tensions, option considerations, tests, child arguments, and evidence.",
